    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i drank the juice and i think it helped a little but i'm still feeling really shaky and my head is pounding. i dont have any glucose tablets or anything, just juice and some bread. can i just eat a bunch of bread and drink more juice now to be safe? i really dont want to call an ambulance if i can just fix this with food. how much bread is enough to stop this from happening again in an hour?",
